          "short": "Triangle with $AB=8\\text{ cm}$, $\\angle A=40^\\circ$ and $\\angle B=30^\\circ$, as shown.",
          "worked": "Draw $AB=8\\text{ cm}$. At $A$, use a protractor to draw a ray making $40^\\circ$ with $AB$. At $B$, draw a ray making $30^\\circ$ with $BA$, on the same side of $AB$. Label the intersection $C$.",
